mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">R&amp;D</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">산업인턴 지원사업을 위한 학생 설명회를 다음과 같이 실시</span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span></font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">점심식사 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 3,4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업유예자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기초과자 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></strong></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">ICT </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">관련학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전자공학계열</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">컴퓨터계열</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">는 미래부 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘ICT </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학점 연계 프로젝트 인턴십</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사업과의 중복성 문제로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생 설명회에 참석은 가능하나 본 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">R&amp;D</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">산업인턴 지원사업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에는 참여할 수 없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일시 및 장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">:</span></strong></font><